      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "There are some worlds in the Community Spotlight that hasn't been updated for a long time since the 2017 Unity update nor has some people been visiting some of those worlds and yet they are still in the list. I think its time for some worlds to be on the list that some people worked hard on and remove some world that hasn't been updated using Unity 2017 and let the community decide so others can get the chance to be on the list. Weekly or Monthly Community Spotlight.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
