  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-11-01T05:54:59.779Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It seems a bit odd that Community Spotlighted worlds don't actually get picked by the community but from behind the doors. I'm not very good at details so i'll keep my suggestion brief: Perhaps have a poll every week that the community can vote on certain worlds that are selected out of a pool.\n\nBest I could come up with, if anyone has any better ideas, do comment!",
